{"unit_id":"divelife__dsh-http-header-limit#feature-1","repo":"divelife/dsh-http-header-limit","commit":"018ab7b87d28d693aa09d854771dce6ca1734ec8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-http-header-limit 的功能「提高请求头上限」：服务监听后将 DSH webServer 的 maxHeaderSize 设为 262144 字节，并确认设置生效，以容纳更大的请求头。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:19-20","index.js:52-60","index.js:68-80"]}
